OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FContinuing   
OL,6,Fto stay mainly dry through the         
OL,7,Fevening, with some clear spells but    
OL,8,Fthere will be a few showers across     
OL,9,Fsouthern and central areas. Overnight  
OL,10,Fclear spells will bring patchy         
OL,11,Ffreezing fog. Light and variable       
OL,12,Fwinds, frosty.                         
OL,14,CSaturday:FBright or sunny intervals    
OL,15,Fbut cloud tending to increase, chance  
OL,16,Fof a few showers over eastern          
OL,17,Fcounties. Freshening southeasterly     
OL,18,Fbreeze.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
